                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--4" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2026-07-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">07/2026</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--4" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Can be used to by the State’s Attorney to notify the court of that office’s position on a juvenile expungement petition.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--4" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/ccjre005.pdf">CC-JRE-005 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--4" class="views-field views-field-title">Notice of Right to Object to Expungement of Juvenile Records                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--4" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2017-10-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">10/2017</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--4" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>This notice states the rights of victims and victims' family members to object to the expungement of a juvenile court record.&nbsp;</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--4" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/ccjre006.pdf">CC-JRE-006 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--4" class="views-field views-field-title">Objection to Expungement of Juvenile Records                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--4" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2017-10-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">10/2017</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--4" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form if you are a victim or a victim's family member, and you object to the expungement of a juvenile record.&nbsp;</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--4" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/ccjre012.pdf">CC-JRE-012 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--4" class="views-field views-field-title">Information on Victim(s) and Family Member(s)                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--4" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2017-10-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">10/2017</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--4" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Can be used by the State's Attorney/Victim Witness Coordinator in a current delinquency or CINS case, to identify each victim and family.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--4" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/ccjre013.pdf">CC-JRE-013 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--4" class="views-field views-field-title">Juvenile Record Expungement Information for Victims and Family Members                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--4" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2022-01-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">01/2022</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--4" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this information sheet to learn about juvenile record expungement.&nbsp;</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--4" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/juv-11-506.1.pdf">JUV 11-506.1 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--4" class="views-field views-field-title">Petition for Expungement of Juvenile Records                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--4" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2022-01-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">01/2022</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--4" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form to ask the court to expunge court records&nbsp;in a juvenile case.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--4" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/juv-11-506.3.pdf">JUV 11-506.3 </a>                </td>
