                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--6" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form if requesting to shield domestic violence (CC-DC-DV-021 A or B) or peace order (CC-DC-PO-016 A or B) records and it is earlier than three (3) years after the denial or dismissal of the <span><span><span>petition or after the consent expires. This is a release of all the requesting party’s claims for damages relating to this proceeding and &nbsp;any and all tort claims that may arise out of this &nbsp;proceeding.</span></span></span></p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
