                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form to respond to or "answer" a guardianship petition that has been filed with the court.&nbsp;</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/family/forms/ccgn005.pdf/ccgn005.pdf">CC-GN-005 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Notice to Interested Persons - Guardian of the Person                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2020-11-20T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">11/2020</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>This notice alerts individuals that court documents have been filed that may result in someone they know losing valuable&nbsp;rights to make individual decisions.&nbsp;</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/family/forms/ccgn006.pdf/ccgn006.pdf">CC-GN-006 </a>                </td>
