                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form to tell the court about your good faith efforts to locate interested persons in a guardianship case.&nbsp;</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/family/forms/ccgn011.pdf/ccgn011.pdf">CC-GN-011 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Inventory and Information Report                 </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2024-04-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">04/2024</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form if you are a guardian of the property to file your initial inventory with the court. <a href="https://mdcourts.gov/sites/default/files/court-forms/family/forms/ccgnin011.pdf/ccgnin011.pdf">Learn more</a>.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/family/forms/ccgn012.pdf/ccgn012.pdf">CC-GN-012 </a>                </td>
