                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form if you are a guardian of the person of an adult to file your annual report to the court.&nbsp;</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/family/forms/ccgn014.pdf/ccgn014.pdf">CC-GN-014 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Annual Report of Guardian of a Minor                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2026-10-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">10/2026</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form if you are a guardian of the person of a minor to file your annual report to the court.&nbsp;</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/family/forms/ccgn015.pdf/ccgn015.pdf">CC-GN-015 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Advice of Rights - Guardian of the Person                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2020-08-06T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">08/2020</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>This notice advises individuals of their rights after a petition has been filed with the court seeking appointment of a guardian of his or her person. &nbsp;</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/family/forms/ccgn016.pdf/ccgn016.pdf">CC-GN-016 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Advice of Rights - Guardian of the Property                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2020-08-06T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">08/2020</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>This notice advises individuals of their rights after a petition has been filed with the court seeking appointment of a guardian of his or her property.&nbsp;</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/family/forms/ccgn018.pdf/ccgn018.pdf">CC-GN-018 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Co-Petitioner Information Sheet                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2025-10-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">10/2025</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form if you are a co-petitioner for guardianship of a minor or an alleged disabled person.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/family/forms/ccgn019.pdf/ccgn019.pdf">CC-GN-019 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Certificate - Guardianship Capacity Assessment                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2026-10-13T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">10/13/2026</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p><span>This form must be used to document examinations or evaluations conducted on or after January 1, 2027. The court may accept certificates completed on this form or on prior versions (i.e., revised before 10/2026) of forms CC-GN-019, CC-GN-020, CC-GN-021, and CC-GN-050 based on examinations or evaluations conducted on or before December 31, 2026. See Maryland Rules 10-202(a)(1) and 10-301(d)(1).&nbsp;</span></p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/ccgn022.pdf">CC-GN-022 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Medical Certificate - Cessation of Disability Requiring a Guardian                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2026-10-13T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">10/13/2026</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form to determine whether to terminate (end) a guardianship based on an adult person under guardianship no longer having a condition that requires a guardianship of the person, guardianship of the property, or both. Only a licensed physician can complete this certificate.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/family/forms/ccgn023.pdf/ccgn023.pdf">CC-GN-023 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Prospective Guardian Information Sheet                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2026-10-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">10/2026</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form if you want the court to appoint you as guardian of a minor or alleged disabled person,but you are not the petitioner (the person asking the court to appoint a guardian for the minor or alleged disabled person).</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/family/forms/ccgn024.pdf/ccgn024.pdf">CC-GN-024 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Proof of Restricted Guardianship Account                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2020-08-06T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">08/2020</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form if you are a guardian of the property and the court ordered you to place guardianship funds in a restricted account.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/family/forms/ccgn025.pdf/ccgn025.pdf">CC-GN-025 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Guardian of the Property Commission Worksheet                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2021-07-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">07/2021</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form if you are the guardian of the property of a minor or disabled person and are asking the court for a commission to be paid from the guardianship estate.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/ccgn026.pdf">CC-GN-026 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Petition for Resignation of Guardian of the Person and Appointment of Substituted or Successor Guardian                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2026-10-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">10/2026</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form if you want to resign as guardian of the person of a minor or disabled person.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/ccgn027.pdf">CC-GN-027 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Petition for Resignation of Guardian of the Property and Appointment of Substituted or Successor Guardian                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2026-10-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">10/2026</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form if you want to resign as guardian of the property of a minor or disabled person.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/ccgn028.pdf">CC-GN-028 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Petition for Termination of Guardianship of the Person                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2026-10-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">10/2026</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form to ask the court to terminate the guardianship of the person of a minor or disabled person.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/ccgn029.pdf">CC-GN-029 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Petition for Termination of Guardianship of the Property                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2026-10-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">10/2026</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form to ask the court to terminate the guardianship of the property of a minor or disabled person.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/family/forms/ccgn030.pdf/ccgn030.pdf">CC-GN-030 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Consent of Substituted or Successor Guardian                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2026-10-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">10/2026</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form if you agree to step in as the guardian of a minor or disabled person when an appointed guardian resigns or is removed.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/family/forms/ccgn031.pdf/ccgn031.pdf">CC-GN-031 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Certificate of Completion- Guardian Orientation and Training                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2026-10-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">10/2026</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>File this form as proof that you completed the orientation and/or the training program for guardians of the person and property.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/family/forms/ccgn032.pdf/ccgn032.pdf">CC-GN-032 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Motion for Appropriate Relief - Guardianship Proceeding                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2026-10-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">10/2026</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form if you are the guardian of a minor or disabled person and want the court’s permission to take an action not allowed in the order appointing you as guardian or that requires court permission.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/family/forms/ccgn033.pdf/ccgn033.pdf">CC-GN-033 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Petition for Appointment of Health Care Professionals                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2026-10-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">10/2026</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form if you are asking the court for guardianship of an alleged disabled person who lives with or is under the control of someone who refuses to allow him or her to be examined or evaluated by health care professionals (physician, psychologist, or licensed certified social worker-clinical).</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/family/forms/ccgn034.pdf/ccgn034.pdf">CC-GN-034 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Petition for Removal of Guardian and Appointment of a Substituted or Successor Guardian                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2026-10-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">10/2026</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form if you are an interested person to a guardianship and want the court to remove a guardian of the person or guardian of the property of a minor or disabled person.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/ccgn035.pdf">CC-GN-035 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Petition to Transfer Guardianship to Another County                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2026-10-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">10/2026</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form if you are the guardian of a minor or disabled person and want the guardianship to be transferred to the circuit court in another county in Maryland.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/ccgn036.pdf">CC-GN-036 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Petition to Transfer Guardianship to Another State                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2026-10-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">10/2026</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form if you are the guardian of a disabled person or minor and want the court to transfer the guardianship from Maryland to another state.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/ccgn037.pdf">CC-GN-037 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Petition for Termination of Guardianship of the Person and Property                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2024-04-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">04/2024</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form to ask the court to terminate the guardianship of the person and property of a minor or disabled person.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/ccgn038.pdf">CC-GN-038 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Petition for Resignation of Guardian of the Person and Property and Appointment of Substituted or Successor Guardian                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2024-08-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">08/2024</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form if you want to resign as guardian of the person and property of a minor or disabled person.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/ccgn039.pdf">CC-GN-039 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Waiver of Notice - Interested Person                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2020-08-06T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">08/2020</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form if you are an interested person (other than the minor or disabled person) and do not want to receive these notices.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/ccgn040.pdf">CC-GN-040 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Revocation of Waiver of Notice - Interested Person                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2020-08-06T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">08/2020</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form if you are an interested person (other than the minor or disabled person) who asked the court to waive your right to notice in a guardianship case and want to revoke that waiver.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/ccgn041.pdf">CC-GN-041 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Parental Designation and Consent to the Beginning of Standby Guardianship                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2025-02-24T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">02/2025</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form to designate an adult to be standby guardian of your minor child(ren) if you become mentally incapacitated, physically debilitated, or subject to an adverse immigration action.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/ccgn042.pdf">CC-GN-042 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Petition by Standby Guardian (Judicial Appointment)                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2024-08-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">08/2024</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form if a parent designated you as standby or alternate standby guardian of his/her minor&nbsp;child(ren), has not revoked your authority, and you want your authority to last more than 180 days.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/ccgn043.pdf">CC-GN-043 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Petition by Parent (Appointment of Standby Guardian)                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2026-10-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">10/2026</time>
                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-body-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-body"><p>Use this form to ask the court to appoint an adult to be standby guardian of your minor child(ren) should you become mentally incapacitated or die within two years of filing this petition.</p>                </td>
                    </tr>
            <tr>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-form-document-1-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-form-document-1"><a href="/sites/default/files/court-forms/ccgn044.pdf">CC-GN-044 </a>                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-title-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-title">Notice to Interested Persons (Md. Rule 10-402(e))                </td>
                                                                                                                                            <td headers="view-field-last-revised-table-column--8" class="views-field views-field-field-last-revised"><time datetime="2025-10-01T12:00:00Z" class="datetime">10/2025</time>
                </td>
